.TH XD\-HELP 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-help \- Help and Support
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-help
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-help
is Help and Support, from the Start menus' Help items: a few pages about
XeonDesktop (starting programs, the keyboard, settings) in the shape of
Windows 2000's help window, the topics on the left and the page on the
right.
The last page says where the help of the programs themselves is, and opens
the system's help viewer (whatever handles
.B help:
addresses, such as Yelp) when one is installed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-shell (1),
.BR man (1)
